  unitName: Fiend Master Vermilion
  unitId: 10775
  unitNumber: 1177
  description: The empress of the rising Agni Empire. The following year after ancient
    Vriksha suffered from a terrible plague, Vermilion built an army to search for
    fertile land in which to grow crops for her empire. However, her troops encountered
    a demon during one of their marches and were crushed by its immense power, along
    with the hopes of the empress. It is said that Vermilion ordered her forces to
    retreat while she remained behind, fighting the demon until every single one
    of her men had escaped.
  summonDesc: Your enemies are demons?<br>Then I shall help you...<br>I will turn
    them to ashes!
  fusionDesc: So you've gotten used to serving me.<br>Well, I dare say that you are
    now<br>my third most trusted servant.
  evoDesc: This is like preparation for battle.<br>I can feel my blood boiling.<br>I'm
    quite excited, you know.
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
